WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.233
Adding with a new ten

2
00:00:03.233 --> 00:00:09.533
We are sorting books in the school library. Let us add two piles together.

3
00:00:10.033 --> 00:00:13.167
Twenty-seven plus fifteen.

4
00:00:13.167 --> 00:00:18.533
First add the ones: seven and five is twelve.

5
00:00:18.533 --> 00:00:22.000
Ten ones make one ten.

6
00:00:22.000 --> 00:00:26.600
Now there are four tens and two ones: forty-two.
